  "title": "Personalized Basketball Close Up with Number Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-close-up-with-number-blanket-with-name-and-number-f16f46abef-f16f46abef",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in your passion for the game with this personalized basketball blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this cozy blanket features a striking close-up design of a basketball and can be customized with your own name and jersey number, making it a unique and thoughtful gift or a standout addition to your sports-themed decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this blanket with your own name and jersey number for a truly unique and personal touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with two layers of polyester fabric, available in ultra-soft fleece or plush sherpa options for maximum warmth and comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes to suit your needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for curling up on the sofa or couch, adding an extra layer to your bed, or taking along on travels, camping trips, and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low air-dry cycle to keep its fluffy texture and vibrant colors.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
